      },
      "flavourText": "",
      "sidebarText": "<h3 class=\"title\"><img alt=\"Sidebar - Related Creatures\" title=\"Sidebar - Related Creatures\" style=\"height:20px; padding:2px 10px 0px 2px\" src=\"Images\\Icons\\Sidebar_4_RelatedCreatures.png\"> Shocker Lizard Traps</h3>Kobolds are particularly fond of using shocker lizards in their trap designs, although such traps rarely keep the shocker lizards&apos; safety and comfort in mind, forcing these cruel but creative kobolds to constantly replace the permanently restrained lizards they&apos;ve set up to defend their lairs.",
